Server --> WebApp : Return correct code
Server --> MobileApp : Send all codes, nonce, expiry

== User Interaction ==
User -> MobileApp : Selects correct code
MobileApp -> MobileApp : Sign (ID:code:expiry:nonce)
MobileApp -> Server : POST /verify-response

== Verification ==
Server -> ChallengeStore : Load challenge by ID
Server -> Server : Check expiry, nonce, signature
Server -> Server : Compare selected code
Server --> MobileApp : Return success or failure

